      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785368376.4133055
    },
    {
      "id": "18090782837531889",
      "text": "eating fruit after a meal is elite behavior.\n\nif you skip the dessert, you\u2019re winning.",
      "posted_at": 1784799238.5282228,
      "views": 415,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 6,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785368376.4133055
    },
    {
      "id": "18113439542483047",
      "text": "is it just me or does the internet feel like it\u2019s becoming a giant library of people arguing about things they don\u2019t understand?",
      "posted_at": 1784811631.4572167,
      "views": 75,
      "replies": 2,
      "likes": 2,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785368376.4133055
    },
    {
      "id": "18019789856855687",
      "text": "people who fold their pizza slice in half are the only ones eating it correctly.",
      "posted_at": 1784825052.7328286,
      "views": 70,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785368376.4133055
    },
    {
      "id": "17901688305525499",
      "text": "you either sleep with the fan on full blast or you\u2019re lying to yourself.",
